调用函数：

function de = sys821 (t,e)

global a b beta R

de1 = e(2);

if ((e(1) + beta * e(2))< -a)

de2 = b;

elseif (abs(e(1) + beta * e(2))<=a)

de2 = 0;

else

de2 = -b;

end

de = [de1 de2]';
